                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum to the French and Netherlands
                        Representatives to the Combined Chiefs of Staff</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The Combined Chiefs of Staff have given consideration to the question of
                    French/Netherlands participation in the war against Japan and wish to inform you of their views which are as
                    follows:—</p>
                <p>[Here follow paragraphs 1<hi rendition="#italic">a</hi> and 1<hi
                        rendition="#italic">b</hi> of the covering memorandum.]</p>
